<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41651" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχορηγ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>supply, furnish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Dioptr.</u>
				31
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρμα τῷ σπείροντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					9.10
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμῖν τὸ πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
					3.5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐοικέναι τοῖς νοητοῖς εἴδεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					341
				</span></i>
			 ; esp. of a husband, <i>provide for</i> a wife, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῇ γαμουμένῃ τὰ δέοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					905.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				282.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; conversely, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν [γυνὴ] ἐ. τῷ ἀνδρὶ αὐτῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					25.22(30)
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀπὸ Λιμυρικῆς -ούμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς παρ᾽ ἑτέρων -ηθεῖσι πλούτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.42
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν τὸ σῶμα διὰ τῶν
					ἁφῶν..ἐπιχορηγούμενον καὶ συμβιβαζόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Col.</u>
					2.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
